%% Expanded timeline for Journey to the West
%% English-major content with Chinese auxiliary hints
timeline
    title Journey to the West - Full Narrative Timeline Fixture
    section Prelude
        Primordial Birth : Stone Monkey emerges from cosmic rock
                         : Trains under Subhuti and masters transformations
        Havoc in Heaven : Rejects insulting rank in Heaven
                        : Battles celestial armies and is sealed under mountain
    section Mission Launch
        Imperial Mandate : Xuanzang receives decree to retrieve true sutras
                         : Route charter and religious authorization completed
        Team Assembly : Sun Wukong released at Five Elements Mountain
                      : Bajie and Wujing join through separate redemption arcs
    section Early Route
        Mountain Segment : Demon caves, illusion traps, and hostage tactics
        White Bone Arc : Trust crisis around repeated disguises
                       : Doctrine and evidence protocol tightened
    section Middle Route
        River and Kingdoms : Crossing logistics, climate barriers, court politics
                           : Daughter Kingdom and legal-ritual dilemmas
        Fire Barrier Arc : Flaming Mountain blockade
                         : Fan acquisition through negotiation and conflict
    section Late Route
        Fortress Campaigns : Lion Camel Ridge and layered strongholds
                           : Multi-stage branch decisions under high risk
        Monastery Approach : Small Thunderclap detour
                           : Canon authenticity concerns emerge
    section Completion
        Final Verification : True sutras confirmed after correction loop
        Return East : Translation, archiving, and mission closure
                    : Auxiliary note (中文): 取经圆满, 团队俱成
